5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about external factors. Let’s check winter road closures and supplier delivery windows.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I want to see what actually worked. I’ll review the two programmes begun six years ago.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,Staff capacity is key. I’ll check the volunteer register and evening room bookings.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,Funding shapes matter. I’ll look at county grant terms and running lines last year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Access is critical. I’ll examine bus links in the outer wards and attendance sheets.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, past records are honest. I hope the delivery windows aren’t a trap.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, agreed. If the past failed, repeating it is foolish. I’ll stick to my two.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, budget lines are dry. I need to know if we have the hands to run this.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, valid. But without stable funding, the hands are irrelevant. I’ll confirm my choices.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, if roads close, the service fails. I’m worried about the outer wards.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I’ll stick with my two choices. I need to know if the weather will break us.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll stick with my two choices. The data will show if we’re repeating mistakes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I’ll stick with my two choices. I need to verify the staffing reality before we commit.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I’ll stick with my two choices. The funding structure is the only thing that matters.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll stick with my two choices. I need to see who can actually reach us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Let’s see what the data says. I’m ready to look into the risks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. Let’s not guess. I’ll review the historical performance before we vote.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,Agreed. I’ll verify the roster. We can’t promise what we can’t staff.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,Agreed. I’ll trace the money. It’s the only reliable metric we have.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Agreed. I’ll check the access. If they can’t get here, it’s useless.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
