35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The delivery windows slip for big clients. That’s a risk for any new equipment.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The old digitisation project left half the images unindexed. We shouldn’t repeat that failure.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,No one is trained to supervise outside facilitators. That’s a gap we can’t ignore.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The grant only covers twelve months. After that, the operating budget carries the cost.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Two outer wards lost their bus link. Residents face an hour’s round trip now.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Minako, if the grant ends, we’re stuck. I’m worried about the long-term cost.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, if we can’t supervise, the program fails. We need internal capacity.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, exactly. The volunteer register shows tradespeople, but no supervisors. That’s a problem.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Yumi, the running lines overran by a third. The equipment was under budget, though.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, the road closures didn’t stop the community halls. They kept their own timetables.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that’s good to know. The halls are resilient. But our suppliers are not.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, the equipment was under budget. That’s a positive sign for capital items.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, but the supervision gap remains. We need to check if we can hire or train.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, hiring is expensive. The endowment covers capital, not ongoing staff.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, the attendance sheets show forty visitors a session in the outer wards. That’s high demand.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m concerned about the supplier delays. We need a plan that doesn’t rely on them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. The past shows we can’t trust external partners to finish the job.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"I agree. We need a solution that uses our existing staff, not new hires.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,"I agree. The funding is tight. We need a low-cost, high-impact solution.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. The demand is there. We just need to reach them.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
